Package: cyrevision
Version: @VERSION@
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Maintainer: CyRevision contributors <noreply@cyrevision.local>
Homepage: https://github.com/MrMybal/CyRevision
Depends: libx11-6, libice6, libsm6, libfontconfig1
Description: Revision control for large creative projects
 CyRevision combines local Git and Git LFS workflows with optional peer-to-peer
 synchronization, versioned backups, asset inspection, and Unreal integration.
